OL,3,GNEWSAMixed reaction as Strabane
OL,4,Awithdraws from UK Town of Culture bid
OL,5,Adue to 'great division'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe motion, which was put forward by
OL,8,Findependent councillors, was backed by
OL,9,Fthe Social Democratic and Labour Party
OL,10,F(SDLP) and Sinn Fein, both of whom had
OL,11,Foriginally supported the bid.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
